{
	"note": "H2g (2026-11-22): config of tools/port_vibelin_food.py - Vibelin's own food, drink and vessels (rows of selection.tsv whose pick is vibelin) for the module's food (survival/, Ratwood's). Read beside items_vibelin/port.json, whose source, assets, defines, slot flags, material ingots and numbers it shares.",
